{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32227","headline":"投翰林萧舍人 · 温庭筠","name":"投翰林萧舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间鵷鹭杳难从，独恨金扉直九重。\n万象晚归仁寿镜，百花春隔景阳钟。\n紫微芒动词初出，红烛香残诰未封。\n每过朱门爱庭树，一枝何日许相容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}